d", "basis": "AMGT_CORPUS round 6 h-2 @6d18367755: the 0.33-0.5 bin is EMPTY over 97 measured block keys and the only name below 0.33 is refused for a different cause, so this floor has never decided a case in the measured population."}, "high": {"value": 3.0, "calibration": "measured", "basis": "AMGT_CORPUS round 6 h-2 @6d18367755: over 97 measured block keys two names sit inside the ceiling between 2.5 and 3.0 and one sits just outside at 3.043, so this ceiling discriminates real cases."}}, "label": "Opal's historical-multiple reference", "formula_words": "Bloomberg consensus EPS (FY1) x adjusted trailing-median P/E"}, "upside": {"status": "ABSENT", "reason": "methodology to be discussed with Andrew"}, "downside": {"status": "ABSENT", "reason": "methodology to be discussed with Andrew"}}, "model": {"security_key": "AMD_US_Equity", "identity": {"security_key": "AMD_US_Equity", "identity_status": "MEASURED", "crosswalk_vintage": "2026-09-29", "crosswalk_source": "s3://opal-data-harvest/crosswalk/v1/2026-09-29.json", "display_ticker": "AMD US", "bloomberg": "AMD US", "requested": "AMD_US_Equity", "identity_basis": "crosswalk/v1"}, "model_status": "SERVED", "fiscal_years": ["2016", "2017", "2018", "2019", "2020", "2021", "2022", "2023", "2024", "2025"], "fiscal_year_figures": [{"scope": "fiscal_year_line_item", "fiscal_year": "2016", "mnemonic": "PX_LAST", "value": 11.34, "unit": "PRICE (local trading currency, per share/unit)", "sign": "POSITIVE", "basis": {"mnemonic": "PX_LAST", "definition": "Last traded/closing price, in the security's trading currency."}, "vintage": "2026-09-30T09:37:48Z", "source": "bloomberg-dapi", "currency_caveat": null, "currency": "USD", "currency_basis": "quote (CRNCY)"}, {"scope": "fiscal_year_line_item", "fiscal_year": "2016", "mnemonic": "SALES_REV_TURN", "value": 4319.0, "unit": "MILLIONS", "sign": "POSITIVE", "basis": {"mnemonic": "SALES_REV_TURN", "definition": "Total revenue/turnover, millions of the reporting currency."}, "vintage"